# 基础词 Unit25
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit25核心词汇

{{tackle}}{{/ˈtækl}}{{v./n. 处理；对付；阻截}}{{We need to tackle the problem before it gets worse.}}
{{talent}}{{/ˈtælənt}}{{n. 才能；天赋；人才}}{{She has a natural talent for painting.}}
{{target}}{{/ˈtɑːɡɪt}}{{n./v. 目标；瞄准；针对}}{{The company targeted young consumers with its new product.}}
{{technique}}{{/tekˈniːk}}{{n. 技术；技巧}}{{The artist uses a unique technique in his paintings.}}
{{temporary}}{{/ˈtemprəri}}{{adj. 暂时的；临时的}}{{She found a temporary job for the summer.}}
{{tend}}{{/tend}}{{v. 倾向于；照料}}{{People tend to eat more in cold weather.}}
{{terminal}}{{/ˈtɜːmɪnl}}{{n./adj. 终端；航站楼；晚期的}}{{Passengers should arrive at the terminal two hours early.}}
{{territory}}{{/ˈterətəri}}{{n. 领土；领域；范围}}{{The country defended its territory against invasion.}}
{{theme}}{{/θiːm}}{{n. 主题；题目}}{{The theme of the conference is sustainability.}}
{{theory}}{{/ˈθɪəri}}{{n. 理论；学说}}{{The theory was supported by experimental evidence.}}
{{therapy}}{{/ˈθerəpi}}{{n. 治疗；疗法}}{{Physical therapy helped him recover from the injury.}}
{{thorough}}{{/ˈθʌrə}}{{adj. 彻底的；仔细的}}{{The police conducted a thorough investigation.}}
{{threat}}{{/θret}}{{n. 威胁；恐吓}}{{Climate change is a threat to global food security.}}
{{thrive}}{{/θraɪv}}{{v. 繁荣；茁壮成长}}{{The business has thrived under new management.}}
{{tolerate}}{{/ˈtɒləreɪt}}{{v. 容忍；忍受}}{{I cannot tolerate such rude behavior.}}
{{tough}}{{/tʌf}}{{adj. 艰难的；坚韧的；强硬的}}{{The exam was really tough this year.}}
{{trace}}{{/treɪs}}{{v./n. 追踪；痕迹；微量}}{{The police traced the call to a mobile phone.}}
{{track}}{{/træk}}{{n./v. 轨道；追踪；跑道}}{{The hunter tracked the deer through the forest.}}
{{trade}}{{/treɪd}}{{n./v. 贸易；交易；行业}}{{International trade has increased significantly.}}
{{tradition}}{{/trəˈdɪʃn}}{{n. 传统；惯例}}{{It is a tradition to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.}}
{{traffic}}{{/ˈtræfɪk}}{{n. 交通；流量}}{{Traffic congestion is a common problem in big cities.}}
{{trail}}{{/treɪl}}{{n./v. 小径；跟踪；拖拽}}{{They followed the trail through the forest.}}
{{transfer}}{{/trænsˈfɜːr}}{{v./n. 转移；转让；调动}}{{He transferred to a new department.}}
{{transform}}{{/trænsˈfɔːm}}{{v. 转变；改造}}{{Technology has transformed the way we live.}}
{{translate}}{{/trænsˈleɪt}}{{v. 翻译；转化}}{{She translated the document from Chinese to English.}}
{{transmit}}{{/trænsˈmɪt}}{{v. 传输；传播；发射}}{{The disease can be transmitted through contaminated water.}}
{{transparent}}{{/trænsˈpærənt}}{{adj. 透明的；明显的}}{{The company should be more transparent about its finances.}}
{{transport}}{{/trænsˈpɔːt}}{{v./n. 运输；交通}}{{The goods were transported by truck.}}
{{trap}}{{/træp}}{{n./v. 陷阱；困住}}{{The mouse was caught in a trap.}}
{{treat}}{{/triːt}}{{v./n. 对待；治疗；请客}}{{The doctor treated the patient with a new drug.}}
{{treaty}}{{/ˈtriːti}}{{n. 条约；协定}}{{The two countries signed a peace treaty.}}
{{trend}}{{/trend}}{{n. 趋势；潮流}}{{There is a growing trend towards online education.}}
{{trial}}{{/ˈtraɪəl}}{{n. 试验；审判；试用期}}{{The trial lasted for three weeks.}}
{{trigger}}{{/ˈtrɪɡər}}{{v./n. 触发；引起；扳机}}{{The crisis triggered a wave of protests.}}
{{triumph}}{{/ˈtraɪʌmf}}{{n./v. 胜利；成功}}{{The team's triumph was celebrated by fans worldwide.}}
{{tropical}}{{/ˈtrɒpɪkl}}{{adj. 热带的}}{{The tropical climate is hot and humid all year.}}
{{trust}}{{/trʌst}}{{n./v. 信任；信赖}}{{Trust is the foundation of any good relationship.}}
{{turbulent}}{{/ˈtɜːbjələnt}}{{adj. 动荡的；湍流的}}{{The country went through a turbulent period of reform.}}
{{typical}}{{/ˈtɪpɪkl}}{{adj. 典型的；有代表性的}}{{This is a typical example of Chinese architecture.}}
{{ultimate}}{{/ˈʌltɪmət}}{{adj. 最终的；根本的}}{{The ultimate goal is to achieve world peace.}}
{{undergo}}{{/ˌʌndəˈɡəʊ}}{{v. 经历；承受}}{{The patient underwent surgery last week.}}
{{undermine}}{{/ˌʌndəˈmaɪn}}{{v. 暗中破坏；削弱}}{{His actions undermined the team's confidence.}}
{{undertake}}{{/ˌʌndəˈteɪk}}{{v. 承担；从事；保证}}{{She undertook the difficult task of organizing the event.}}
{{unemployment}}{{/ˌʌnɪmˈplɔɪmənt}}{{n. 失业；失业率}}{{Unemployment has risen due to the economic downturn.}}
{{unique}}{{/juˈniːk}}{{adj. 独特的；唯一的}}{{Every person has a unique set of fingerprints.}}
{{universal}}{{/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːsl}}{{adj. 普遍的；全球的}}{{Education is a universal right.}}
{{update}}{{/ʌpˈdeɪt}}{{v./n. 更新；最新消息}}{{Please update the software to the latest version.}}
{{upgrade}}{{/ʌpˈɡreɪd}}{{v./n. 升级；提升}}{{The airline upgraded him to first class.}}
{{uphold}}{{/ʌpˈhəʊld}}{{v. 支持；维护；坚持}}{{The court upheld the original decision.}}
{{urban}}{{/ˈɜːbən}}{{adj. 城市的；都市的}}{{Urban areas have better access to healthcare.}}
{{urge}}{{/ɜːdʒ}}{{v./n. 催促；强烈要求；冲动}}{{He urged the government to take immediate action.}}
{{urgent}}{{/ˈɜːdʒənt}}{{adj. 紧急的；迫切的}}{{The situation requires urgent attention.}}
{{utilize}}{{/ˈjuːtɪlaɪz}}{{v. 利用；使用}}{{We should utilize all available resources.}}
{{vacant}}{{/ˈveɪkənt}}{{adj. 空的；空缺的；茫然的}}{{There is a vacant position in the marketing department.}}
{{vague}}{{/veɪɡ}}{{adj. 模糊的；不明确的}}{{His instructions were too vague to follow.}}
{{valid}}{{/ˈvælɪd}}{{adj. 有效的；合理的}}{{The ticket is valid for three months.}}
{{vanish}}{{/ˈvænɪʃ}}{{v. 消失；消亡}}{{The ship vanished into the fog.}}
{{variable}}{{/ˈveəriəbl}}{{adj./n. 可变的；变量}}{{Temperature is a key variable in the experiment.}}
{{variation}}{{/ˌveəriˈeɪʃn}}{{n. 变化；变体；变异}}{{There is considerable variation in test scores.}}
{{variety}}{{/vəˈraɪəti}}{{n. 多样性；种类}}{{The store offers a wide variety of products.}}
{{vast}}{{/vɑːst}}{{adj. 广阔的；大量的}}{{The vast desert stretches for hundreds of miles.}}
{{vehicle}}{{/ˈviːɪkl}}{{n. 车辆；交通工具；手段}}{{Electric vehicles are becoming more popular.}}
{{venture}}{{/ˈventʃər}}{{n./v. 冒险事业；敢于}}{{He started a new venture in the tech industry.}}
{{version}}{{/ˈvɜːʃn}}{{n. 版本；说法}}{{The latest version of the app has new features.}}
{{victim}}{{/ˈvɪktɪm}}{{n. 受害者；牺牲品}}{{The victims of the earthquake received aid from the government.}}
{{violate}}{{/ˈvaɪəleɪt}}{{v. 违反；侵犯}}{{He was arrested for violating the law.}}
{{violence}}{{/ˈvaɪələns}}{{n. 暴力；暴行}}{{Violence is never the solution to a problem.}}
{{virtual}}{{/ˈvɜːtʃuəl}}{{adj. 虚拟的；实际上的}}{{Virtual reality technology is advancing rapidly.}}
{{visible}}{{/ˈvɪzəbl}}{{adj. 看得见的；明显的}}{{The stars were clearly visible in the night sky.}}
{{vision}}{{/ˈvɪʒn}}{{n. 视力；想象；远见}}{{She has a clear vision for the company's future.}}
{{vital}}{{/ˈvaɪtl}}{{adj. 至关重要的；生命的}}{{Water is vital for human survival.}}
{{vivid}}{{/ˈvɪvɪd}}{{adj. 生动的；鲜明的}}{{She gave a vivid description of the event.}}
{{volume}}{{/ˈvɒljuːm}}{{n. 卷；体积；音量；量}}{{The volume of traffic increases during rush hour.}}
{{voluntary}}{{/ˈvɒləntri}}{{adj. 自愿的；志愿的}}{{Participation in the program is voluntary.}}
{{vulnerable}}{{/ˈvʌlnərəbl}}{{adj. 脆弱的；易受伤的}}{{Children are particularly vulnerable to the effects of pollution.}}
{{widespread}}{{/ˈwaɪdspred}}{{adj. 广泛的；普遍的}}{{There is widespread support for the policy.}}
{{willing}}{{/ˈwɪlɪŋ}}{{adj. 愿意的；乐意的}}{{She is willing to help with the project.}}
{{wisdom}}{{/ˈwɪzdəm}}{{n. 智慧；明智}}{{With age comes wisdom.}}
{{withdraw}}{{/wɪðˈdrɔː}}{{v. 撤退；提取；收回}}{{She withdrew money from the bank.}}
{{withstand}}{{/wɪðˈstænd}}{{v. 承受；抵挡}}{{The building can withstand strong earthquakes.}}
{{witness}}{{/ˈwɪtnəs}}{{n./v. 目击者；见证；目击}}{{She witnessed the accident from her window.}}
{{worth}}{{/wɜːθ}}{{adj./n. 值得的；价值}}{{The book is worth reading.}}
{{yield}}{{/jiːld}}{{v./n. 产出；屈服；收益}}{{The farm yields a good harvest every year.}}
{{zone}}{{/zəʊn}}{{n. 地区；区域；地带}}{{The area has been declared a disaster zone.}}
